671 - Now, Dear Lord, As We Pray
 / 
Key: Db
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 671
Topic: Sentences and Responses - 

Verse 1:
[Db]Now, Dear [Fm]Lord, [Db]as [Ab7/Eb]we pray,
[Ebm]take our hearts [Ab]and [Ebm]minds [Ab]far [Cdim]away
[Db]From the press of the world all around
[Bbm]to [Db]your throne where [Bbm]grace does [Ebm]abound.
[Ab]May our lives be transformed [Db]by [Fm]Your love,
[Gb]may our [Bbm]souls be refreshed [Ab7/Eb]from above.
[Db]At this [C7]moment, [Bbm]let people everywhere
[Ab]join us [Ab7/C]now as we come [Db]to You in prayer.
